/**
 * How Embracing flower harness leaves (`daki-hana-gyoyo`) is constructed, in a line in each language: the text a crest's card shows beside its steps.
 * It is here, not on the crest's record, so that the manifest stays small; `crestConstruction()` loads it.
 *
 * @example
 * ```ts no-run
 * import { description } from "@johnmorrisdotca/kamon-crests/steps/daki-hana-gyoyo";
 *
 * console.log(description.en.length > 30, description.ja.endsWith("。")); // true true
 * ```
 */
const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"Two leaves that stand face to face, their backs one circle, with a white slit between them that opens into a drop below the middle, and a round foot each. A leaf has a curled tip, a circle that touches the slit, with a white arc under the curl and a fold that runs down from it. Two round lobes stand down the back under the tip and one lies beside the slit; the lines between them are arcs of one compass width, 96. Below them a wide lobe runs from the slit to the back, its top two arcs that meet over the flower and its foot two arcs that meet under it. The flower is a small disc in a white ring, with six white stamens ruled from its middle, five of them to a white dot. The stalk is two strips with a white line between them, down to the foot; its back is a circle of 92 struck 8 below the centre, so that the wide lobe's corner stands out over it. Two white wedges part the leaves above the wide lobe. The right leaf is built in full and the left one where it stands.","ja":"向かい合う二枚の葉です。背は一つの円で、間に白いすき間があり、中心より下でしずくの形に開きます。下の端は、それぞれ丸い足です。葉の先は巻いていて、すき間に接する円です。巻きの下に白い弧があり、そこから折り目が下へ伸びます。その下に、背にそって丸い山が二つ、すき間の横に一つあります。山の間の線は、どれも同じコンパスの幅96の弧です。その下の広い部分は、すき間から背まであります。上の縁は花の上で出会う二本の弧、下の縁は花の下で出会う二本の弧です。花は白い輪に囲まれた小さな円で、中心から白いしべを六本、定規で引きます。五本の先には白い点があります。柄は白い線で分けた二本の帯で、足まで続きます。柄の背は、中心より8下に描いた半径92の円なので、広い部分の角が柄より外に出ます。広い部分より上では、白いくさびが二つ、葉と葉の間に入ります。右の葉を作図し、左の葉はその場で作図します。"};

export default construction;
export { construction, description };
